# quint ITF traces carry volatile `#meta` timestamp/description fields that
# churn on every re-freeze; the itfmask clean filter masks them so the stored
# blob is stable and git ignores timestamp-only churn. Register once per clone
# (see CONTRIBUTING.md): git config filter.itfmask.clean "node scripts/hooks/mask-itf.mjs"
*.itf.json filter=itfmask
